                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-wide bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-200 to-indigo-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">منصة APK الاحترافية</span>
                        <span class="block text-xs text-brand-500 font-semibold">Bouazza App Store</span>
